      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIG WATCH (5) had been racing in honest fashion recording three placings in a row before finishing fourth (30.49) at this track latest. Got the money at her only try from this box. Rates on top in this line up. OKAY BOSS (7) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished third (35.11) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Leading player again. WHY MUMMY (4) missed the frame last time when fourth (35.19) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Won at his only start from this box. Has the ability to give this a shake. TRACKING YOU (1) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in him.",
